{"results":[{"url":"https://www.the-independent.com/sport/football/international/paul-pogba-quit-french-national-team-islam-emmanuel-macron-terrorism-news-b1342498.html","final_url":"https://www.the-independent.com/sport/football/international/paul-pogba-quit-french-national-team-islam-emmanuel-macron-terrorism-news-b1342498.html","title":"Paul Pogba denies reports he has quit the French national team over Emmanuel Macron’s terrorism comments","description":"Pogba, who converted to Islam in 2011, rejected the reports","language":"en","text":"# Paul Pogba denies reports he has quit French national team over Emmanuel Macron’s terrorism comments\n\nPogba, who converted to Islam in 2011, rejected the reports\n\n# Become an Independent member to bookmark this article\n\nWant to bookmark your favourite articles and stories to read or reference later? Start your Independent Membership today.\n\nJoin today\n\nAlready a member? Log in\n\nPaul Pogba has rejected reports he is ready to quit the French national team over comments about Islam’s role in terrorism by the president, Emmanuel Macron.\n\nReports in the Middle East claimed Pogba had stepped down from national duties over Macron’s description of the murder of French school teacher Samuel Paty as an “Islamic terrorist attack”.\n\nPaty, 47, was targeted for showing cartoons of the Prophet Muhammad to his students. He was beheaded by 18-year-old Abdullakh Anzorov. Seven people has since been detained by French police.\n\nMacron’s strong speech received backlash in some quarters, with Turkish president Recep Erdogan questioning his French counterpart’s mental state.\n\nBut Pogba, who converted to Islam in 2011, rejected the reports on Instagram, posting the caption “fake news” over a headline by The Sun which said he was retiring from international football.\n\n## Join our commenting forum\n\nJoin thought-provoking conversations, follow other Independent readers and see their replies\n\nComments","author":"Sports Staff","published_date":"2020-10-26T12:00:48.000Z","latency_ms":1258.5378999992827,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}